body:

PyCon DE & PyData 2026 took place 14–17 April 2026 at the darmstadtium in Darmstadt: 145 sessions across 20 [tracks](tracks/), from 165 [speakers](speakers/).

Every session has a page here, with its abstract, speakers and — where a recording exists — the video. Browse the [full programme](talks/), or filter it by track, format and level.
